         About the Town Clerk  The Town Clerk's Office is the central gateway to Belmont’s local government and your connection to state and federal services. The office oversees all aspects of the voting process, manages public records access, maintains vital records, and issues various municipal licenses. Location: Ground floor of Town Hall  455 Concord Avenue, Belmont, MA 02478 
     

 
