						 	 Election & Census Activities 




 
	     


         To support local democracy and maintain accurate demographic records, the office handles: Voter Management:  Coordinating voter registration, maintaining official voting lists, and certifying nomination papers or initiative petitions. Election Administration:  Managing ballot preparation, organizing physical polling locations, and certifying final election results. Compliance Tracking:  Collecting candidate filings, including required campaign finance forms. Annual Town Census:  Mailing the yearly census, publishing Resident Books, and reporting the updated lists of residents directly to the Office of the Jury Commissioner. 
     

 
